# 必考词 Unit08
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-必考词
# 描述: 必考词Unit08核心高频词汇

{{distribute}}{/dɪˈstrɪbjuːt/}}{v. 分配；分发}}{{The charity distributed food and clothing to the homeless.}}

{{diverse}}{/daɪˈvɜːrs/}}{adj. 多样的；不同的}}{{The university attracts students from diverse backgrounds.}}

{{divorce}}{/dɪˈvɔːrs/}}{n./v. 离婚；分离}}{{The rate of divorce has increased in recent decades.}}

{{document}}{/ˈdɒkjumənt/}}{n. 文件；v. 记录}}{{Please keep all the documents related to the transaction.}}

{{domestic}}{/dəˈmestɪk/}}{adj. 国内的；家庭的}}{{Domestic tourism has grown significantly this year.}}

{{dominate}}{/ˈdɒmɪneɪt/}}{v. 支配；占主导地位}}{{The tech giant dominates the global smartphone market.}}

{{donate}}{/dəʊˈneɪt/}}{v. 捐赠；捐献}}{{Many people donated money to the earthquake relief fund.}}

{{dose}}{/dəʊs/}}{n. 剂量；一剂}}{{The doctor prescribed a low dose of the medication.}}

{{doubt}}{/daʊt/}}{n./v. 怀疑；不确定}}{{There is no doubt that education is the key to success.}}

{{draft}}{/drɑːft/}}{n. 草稿；草案；v. 起草}}{{The committee prepared a draft of the new regulation.}}

{{drama}}{/ˈdrɑːmə/}}{n. 戏剧；剧本}}{{She studied drama at a performing arts school.}}

{{drastic}}{/ˈdræstɪk/}}{adj. 激烈的；严厉的}}{{The company took drastic measures to reduce costs.}}

{{drift}}{/drɪft/}}{v./n. 漂流；漂移}}{{The boat drifted slowly down the river.}}

{{drought}}{/draʊt/}}{n. 干旱}}{{The severe drought destroyed crops across the region.}}

{{due}}{/djuː/}}{adj. 到期的；应有的；由于}}{{The report is due by the end of this month.}}

{{dull}}{/dʌl/}}{adj. 迟钝的；无聊的；阴暗的}}{{The lecture was so dull that many students fell asleep.}}

{{dump}}{/dʌmp/}}{v. 倾倒；抛弃}}{{It is illegal to dump toxic waste into the river.}}

{{durable}}{/ˈdjʊərəbl/}}{adj. 耐用的；持久的}}{{The material is both lightweight and durable.}}

{{duration}}{/djʊˈreɪʃn/}}{n. 持续时间}}{{The duration of the course is three months.}}

{{dynamic}}{/daɪˈnæmɪk/}}{adj. 动态的；有活力的}}{{The city has a dynamic and vibrant cultural scene.}}

{{economy}}{/ɪˈkɒnəmi/}}{n. 经济；节约}}{{The global economy is recovering from the pandemic.}}

{{edition}}{/ɪˈdɪʃn/}}{n. 版；版本}}{{The third edition of the textbook includes new chapters.}}

{{editorial}}{/ˌedɪˈtɔːriəl/}}{adj. 编辑的；n. 社论}}{{The newspaper published an editorial on climate change.}}

{{elaborate}}{/ɪˈlæbərət/}}{adj. 精心的；v. 详细阐述}}{{Could you elaborate on your proposal in more detail?}}

{{elect}}{/ɪˈlekt/}}{v. 选举；选择}}{{The people elected a new president last November.}}

{{element}}{/ˈelɪmənt/}}{n. 元素；要素；成分}}{{Oxygen is an essential element for human survival.}}

{{eliminate}}{/ɪˈlɪmɪneɪt/}}{v. 消除；淘汰}}{{The team was eliminated in the first round of the tournament.}}

{{embrace}}{/ɪmˈbreɪs/}}{v. 拥抱；接受}}{{The company decided to embrace new technology.}}

{{emerge}}{/ɪˈmɜːrdʒ/}}{v. 出现；浮现}}{{New evidence emerged during the investigation.}}

{{emergency}}{/ɪˈmɜːrdʒənsi/}}{n. 紧急情况}}{{In case of emergency, dial 119 immediately.}}

{{emit}}{/ɪˈmɪt/}}{v. 发出；排放}}{{The factory emits large amounts of carbon dioxide.}}

{{emotion}}{/ɪˈməʊʃn/}}{n. 情感；情绪}}{{She tried to hide her emotions during the interview.}}

{{emphasis}}{/ˈemfəsɪs/}}{n. 强调；重点}}{{The teacher placed great emphasis on critical thinking.}}

{{empire}}{/ˈempaɪər/}}{n. 帝国}}{{The Roman Empire was one of the largest in history.}}

{{encounter}}{/ɪnˈkaʊntər/}}{v./n. 遇到；遭遇}}{{We encountered several difficulties during the journey.}}

{{encourage}}{/ɪnˈkʌrɪdʒ/}}{v. 鼓励；促进}}{{Parents should encourage children to read more books.}}

{{engage}}{/ɪnˈɡeɪdʒ/}}{v. 从事；吸引；订婚}}{{She is engaged in environmental protection activities.}}

{{enormous}}{/ɪˈnɔːrməs/}}{adj. 巨大的；庞大的}}{{The project requires an enormous investment of time and money.}}

{{ensure}}{/ɪnˈʃʊər/}}{v. 确保；保证}}{{Please ensure that all doors are locked before leaving.}}

{{enterprise}}{/ˈentərpraɪz/}}{n. 企业；事业}}{{Small enterprises play a vital role in the economy.}}
